arly universe (where memory hasn't saturated) to the local universe (where it has), we use a sigmoid centered on the Metabolic Epoch.Implementation Target:We use $x = \\ln(1+z)$ as the "Universal Clock" for its monotonicity.$$S_\{\\text\{phase\}\}(z) = \\frac\{1\}\{1 + e^\{(x - x_0)/w\}\}$$This "snaps" the $217.18$ stationary-phase constant into place at the correct cosmic moment, resolving the $H_0$ tension as a Phase Transition of the Vacuum\
