\f9 \uc0\u9989 
\f0  What I changed (short summary) Backend: Persist runs created by the POST /runs endpoint to the SQLite store so they appear in the library and can be linked. 
\f9 \uc0\u55357 \u56615 
\f0  UI: Track an explicit lastRunId when responses include run_id (captured from /ask, /anamnesis/demo, /anamnesis/search_tau) and use that for "Link last run" (no ambiguous \'93latest library\'94 fallback). 
\f9 \uc0\u55358 \u56813 
