\f9 \uc0\u55357 \u56523 
\f0  
\f9 \uc0\u55357 \u56615 
\f0  Files modified main.py Persist runs inside runs() by calling db_store.save_run(...) (non-blocking; errors swallowed so run behavior remains unaffected). index.html Added lastRunId UI state. Capture run_id in: send() (for /ask) runDemo() (for /anamnesis/demo) runTauSearch() (for /anamnesis/search_tau) linkLastRunToTopic(slug) now uses lastRunId and alerts when no last run is captured. viewTopic(slug) now displays inline evidence header info (engine version, short params hash, short bundle hash, status badge, Export button). 
\f9 \uc0\u55357 \u56481 
\f0  Behavior & how to verify manually Run a run that returns a run_id: Click \'93Ask\'94 (calls /ask) or run an Anamnesis demo / tau search. The client captures that run_id as lastRunId. Switch to GRUTipedia, select a topic, click Link last run to this topic \'97 it will link that specific run_id unambiguously. In the topic view, the related research entries now show: Status badge color-coded (PASS/WARN/FAIL) engine_version short params_hash (first 8 chars) short bundle_hash (first 8 chars) Export button (downloads evidence packet JSON) 
\f9 \uc0\u9989 
